              "lambda_role_arn": "arn:aws:iam::111111111111:role/alex-lambda-aurora-role",
              "setup_instructions": "    \n\u2705 Aurora Serverless v2 cluster deployed successfully!\n    \nDatabase Details:\n- Cluster: alex-aurora-cluster\n- Database: alex\n- Data API: Enabled\n    \nAdd the following to your .env file:\nAURORA_CLUSTER_ARN=arn:aws:rds:us-west-1:111111111111:cluster:alex-aurora-cluster\nAURORA_SECRET_ARN=arn:aws:secretsmanager:us-west-1:111111111111:secret:alex-aurora-credentials-7b1b5cc1-LvvYkh\n    \nTest the Data API connection:\naws rds-data execute-statement \\\n  --resource-arn arn:aws:rds:us-west-1:111111111111:cluster:alex-aurora-cluster \\\n  --secret-arn arn:aws:secretsmanager:us-west-1:111111111111:secret:alex-aurora-credentials-7b1b5cc1-LvvYkh \\\n  --database alex \\\n  --sql \"SELECT version()\"\n    \nTo set up the database schema:\ncd backend/database\nuv run run_migrations.py\n    \nTo load sample data:\nuv run reset_db.py --with-test-data\n    \n\ud83d\udcb0 Cost Management:\n- Current scaling: 0 - 1 ACUs\n- Estimated cost: ~$43/month minimum\n- To pause: Set min_capacity to 0 (cluster will pause after 5 minutes of inactivity)\n"
